{"data":{"description":"SMG Body is the firing mechanism for pistol-ammo SMGs, used in 3 recipes: Custom SMG, MP5A4 and Thompson. The [Travelling Vendor](/world/travelling-vendor) sometimes sells 5 for around 104 scrap. For loot, hit [treasure mission boxes](/world/missionlootbox-basic) (48.8%), elite crates (32.6%) and Military Crates (20%). Selling animals to the [Livestock Vendor](/world/livestock-vendor) can pay out 1-5. In a Green Recycler, one of those SMGs has a 50% chance to return the body, and the body itself gives 15 scrap and 1 HQM, plus a 50% chance at another.","item":{"id":"smgbody","name":"SMG Body","path":"/v1/items/smg-body.json","slug":"smg-body"},"name":"SMG Body","path":"/v1/recycler/smgbody.json","recyclers":[{"guaranteed":[{"amount":22,"item":{"id":"scrap","name":"Scrap","path":"/v1/items/scrap.json","slug":"scrap"}},{"amount":2,"item":{"id":"metal-refined","name":"High Quality Metal","path":"/v1/items/high-quality-metal.json","slug":"high-quality-metal"}}],"percentage":[{"amount":25,"item":{"id":"metal-refined","name":"High Quality Metal","path":"/v1/items/high-quality-metal.json","slug":"high-quality-metal"}}],"recycler":{"id":"recycler-red","name":"Red Recycler","path":"/v1/world/recycler-red.json","slug":"recycler-red"}},{"guaranteed":[{"amount":18,"item":{"id":"scrap","name":"Scrap","path":"/v1/items/scrap.json","slug":"scrap"}},{"amount":1,"item":{"id":"metal-refined","name":"High Quality Metal","path":"/v1/items/high-quality-metal.json","slug":"high-quality-metal"}}],"percentage":[{"amount":80,"item":{"id":"metal-refined","name":"High Quality Metal","path":"/v1/items/high-quality-metal.json","slug":"high-quality-metal"}}],"recycler":{"id":"recycler-green-powered","name":"Green Recycler (powered)","path":"/v1/world/recycler-green-powered.json","slug":"recycler-green-powered"}},{"guaranteed":[{"amount":15,"item":{"id":"scrap","name":"Scrap","path":"/v1/items/scrap.json","slug":"scrap"}},{"amount":1,"item":{"id":"metal-refined","name":"Hig